<h5>@T["Workforce settings"]</h5>
<p class="hint">@T["Exports shift templates, rotations and coverage requirements, time-off types, policies, allotments and blackout dates, the time clock's pay periods, pay codes, policies, kiosks and payroll CSV columns, and the labor rule sets, for the features that are on. Teams, activities, templates, skills and types are written by name. Kiosk addresses are never exported: issue a new address on each kiosk after the import."]</p>
